<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Tuesday 108,000-USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Tuesday 108,000-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Tuesday's actual receipts 108,000 head at interior Iowa/so Minnesota. Opening trade was not well established. Early sales of barrows and gilts were $0.50 lower than the mid-session Tuesday. Top $53.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>			   Couuntry		   Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    50.00 -51.50	   51.00 -52.50</p>
<p>few				 52.00		    53.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady. Top $49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.  40.00 -41.00	   40.00 -43.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   42.00 -44.00	   42.00 -44.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    44.00 -47.00	   44.00 -49.00</p>
